00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Open Automatic tests, then All allowed actions
The task waits for Order and tracking. Details show criteria, dependencies and no report.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Compare the same graph in dark mode
Changing the theme changes neither dependencies nor task status.
